  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To reduce the exported RDF being tied to the original repository URIs, the export client should map the base URIs to info:fedora/ URIs.  For example, the resource ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/a/b/c"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/a/b/c",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " should be mapped to info:fedora/a/b/c",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
